ich divides the values into two equal halves arranged either in", "conf": 0.926, "box": [[190, 1130], [1601, 1066], [1603, 1109], [192, 1173]]}, {"text": "ascending or descending order.", "conf": 0.893, "box": [[191, 1194], [697, 1172], [699, 1211], [193, 1233]]}, {"text": "To find the median;", "conf": 0.837, "box": [[192, 1274], [508, 1263], [510, 1300], [193, 1311]]}, {"text": "i.Arrange the values in ascending order.", "conf": 0.903, "box": [[189, 1336], [850, 1311], [851, 1351], [190, 1376]]}, {"text": "i.  If you have odd numbers of values the median is the middle value.", "conf": 0.913, "box": [[188, 1397], [1294, 1355], [1296, 1398], [190, 1440]]}, {"text": "Let the solve an example:", "conf": 0.883, "box": [[189, 1587], [601, 1573], [603, 1616], [190, 1630]]}, {"text": "Example 1:", "conf": 0.873, "box": [[188, 1659], [383, 1650], [386, 1693], [190, 1702]]}, {"text": "Find the median for the following observations.", "conf": 0.933, "box": [[186, 1706], [929, 1691], [929, 1737], [187, 1751]]}, {"text": "ii. 4, 6, 8, 10, 12, 14", "conf": 0.917, "box": [[718, 1753], [1009, 1755], [1009, 1792], [718, 1790]]}, {"text": "i. 5, 2, 7, 13, 8, 11, 9", "conf": 0.919, "box": [[188, 1768], [504, 1755], [506, 1792], [189, 1804]]}, {"text": "Solution:", "conf": 0.877, "box": [[192, 1848], [351, 1844], [352, 1880], [193, 1885]]}, {"text": "i. First we arrange the observations.", "conf": 0.928, "box": [[186, 1907], [741, 1897], [742, 1941], [187, 1952]]}, {"text": "2, 5, 7, 8, 9, 11, 13.", "conf": 0.858, "box": [[190, 1977], [484, 1965], [486, 2001], [191, 2013]]}, {"text": "Here n = 7", "conf": 0.834, "box": [[190, 2030], [368, 2020], [371, 2057], [192, 2067]]}, {"text": "NOTFORSALE", "conf": 0.868, "box": [[264, 2098], [546, 2089], [547, 2122], [265, 2131]]}, {"text": "225", "conf": 0.563, "box": [[835, 2098], [902, 2098], [902, 2136], [835, 2136]]}]}